  "description": "Redis Streams history for the SinkSharp dashboard. Every pod appends to one stream, so the dashboard shows the recent history of all pods and keeps it across restarts, deployments and scale-in. Optional add-on to SinkSharp.Sinks.Dashboard: the logging thread never waits on Redis, and retention is capped by both age and count.",
