  "published": "2026-11-19T16:31:42.237Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release\n• RedisStreamHistoryStore — dashboard history in a Redis Stream, shared by every pod using the same StreamKey\n• AddSinkSharpDashboardRedisStreams() — history only; AddSinkSharpDashboardRedis(sink, signalR, streams) — backplane + history in one call\n• Non-blocking writes: events are queued and written in pipelined batches on a background task\n• Retention by age (RetentionDays, Redis 6.2+/Valkey) and by count (MaxLength, any Redis 5+)\n• PingAsync() — a real Redis round-trip with its own short timeout, backing the dashboard's /health endpoint and AddSinkSharpDashboardHealthCheck()\n• TotalWritten/TotalDropped now also implement IDashboardHistoryStore's counters, so /stats and /health show them directly\n• Resilient to Redis interruptions: logging and the live stream continue, the dashboard serves each pod's recent events, and shared history resumes automatically\n• Requires SinkSharp.Sinks.Dashboard 1.1.0 or later\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/.github/blob/main/profile/CHANGELOG.md",
